 "build": {
  "id": "63ed0949-23e7-4c9b-9a51-97da32585a8b",
  "title": "Mountain King Dungeon + AoE Farming build",
  "description": "[overview]\nThis is an AoE-focused build with decent single-target for bosses with CDs. I've only been playing Primalist since the project started and have tried min-maxing different builds for each melee spec.\n\nI use this build to do all of Scarlet Monastery - Graveyard in 2 pulls. It is very easy to farm Marks of Triumph this way.\n\n[talents]\nKey talents here are Primal Guardian, Raging Earth, Mountain Fury, and Earthen Avatar.\n\nFlex talents can be any talent that requires one hand or an offhand. I play using two hands, so some talents are only used to get to later talents.\n\n[rotation]\nKey Rotation:\n\nOpen with Quake>Seismic Spike>Earthquake proc>Mountain Fury to group adds. Then spam Hand of the Earthmother on yourself until Quake is off CD.\n\nMaintain Primal Guardian and Heavy-Handed. Maintain at least 1 Earthquake on the ground.\n\nDefensive rotations are Primal Convergence, Bearskin, Rock Barrier (only use when Primal Guardian is falling off), and Mountain Fury.\n\n*Grove Guardians is uncapped AoE DPS/Healing and should always be taken.\n\n[stats]\n*WIP",
